sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant BE as Fastify Backend
    participant FS as Local Filesystem
    participant DB as Postgres (RLS)

    Note over U,FE: Session already established

    U->>FE: Click "Upload document"
    FE->>FE: Read JWT from session
    FE->>BE: POST /v1/documents<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT><br/>{ employeeId, typeKey, file }

    BE->>BE: Verify JWT signature
    Note right of BE: Extract userId, org_id,<br/>role, isPlatformAdmin
    BE->>BE: Zod validate body
    BE->>BE: Check permission (role)
    BE->>BE: Check tier gate (canDo)
    BE->>FS: Write file to UPLOAD_DIR/{org_id}/...
    FS-->>BE: file_path & size
    BE->>DB: withTenant session RLS: INSERT attachment & document
    DB-->>BE: Row
    BE->>DB: INSERT audit_log (doc.upload)
    DB-->>BE: OK
    BE-->>FE: { data: document }
    FE-->>U: Toast + list refresh

    Note over U,FE: Failure path

    U->>FE: Click "Upload document" (over limit)
    FE->>BE: POST /v1/documents
    BE->>BE: Check tier gate → FAIL
    BE-->>FE: 403 { error, code: TIER_LIMIT_EXCEEDED }
    FE-->>U: Alert + upgrade CTA
